      "notes": "Suggested Use: As a dietary supplement, take two (2) capsules daily with a meal and a glass of water, or as directed by your healthcare professional. For those with a more sensitive constitution, we recommend taking one (1) capsule daily with a meal and a full glass of water. \nFor best results, Vimerson Health products should be used alongside a healthy diet and regular exercise."
